msgid "Publish an AI discovery document at /llms.txt"
msgstr "Publier un document de découverte IA sur /llms.txt"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:463
msgid ""
"The document lists selected public and indexable WordPress content. It is "
"disabled by default on upgrade and does not affect search rankings."
msgstr ""
"Le document répertorie le contenu WordPress public et indexable sélectionné. "
