#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:468
msgid "Included content"
msgstr "Contenu inclus"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:469
msgid ""
"Only published, publicly viewable, non-password-protected content is "
"eligible. Content explicitly marked noindex is always excluded."
msgstr ""
"Seul le contenu publié, visible publiquement et non protégé par mot de passe "
"est éligible. Le contenu explicitement marqué noindex est toujours exclu."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:478
